Smart Classroom Attendance and Management System

## 1. Introduction

The Smart Classroom Attendance and Management System is a web-based
application designed to manage classroom attendance digitally.
It helps teachers record, store and view student attendance easily.

## 2. Problem Statement

Traditional attendance systems use paper registers and require
manual record keeping. This process is time-consuming and may
lead to errors. Finding old records and calculating attendance
can also be difficult.

## 3. Objectives

- To digitize the attendance process.
- To reduce manual paperwork.
- To store attendance records digitally.
- To make attendance management easier.
- To reduce errors.
- To generate attendance reports.

## 4. Existing System

In the existing system, teachers generally use a register to
record student attendance manually.

### Disadvantages

- Time-consuming
- Paper-based records
- Difficult to search old records
- Manual calculation
- Possibility of human errors

## 5. Proposed System

The proposed system is a web-based attendance management system.
Teachers can enter student details and mark students as Present
or Absent. The attendance information is processed using PHP
and stored in a MySQL database.

