## 7. Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- PHP
- MySQL
- XAMPP

## 8. Main Modules

### Student Management
Manages student information such as student ID, name and class.

### Attendance Management
Allows the teacher to mark Present or Absent.

### Database Management
Stores attendance records in MySQL.

### Attendance Report
Displays previously stored attendance records.

## 9. Database

The attendance table contains:

- ID
- Student ID
- Student Name
- Class
- Status
- Attendance Date

