## 12. Advantages

- Saves time
- Reduces paperwork
- Easy to maintain
- Easy to access records
- Reduces manual errors

## 13. Limitations

- Requires a computer/server environment.
- Attendance is currently entered manually.
- Advanced authentication is not included in the beginner version.

## 14. Future Scope

- Admin and teacher login
- Student login
- QR-code attendance
- Face-recognition attendance
- Attendance percentage
- Timetable management
- PDF/Excel reports
- Mobile application

## 15. Conclusion

The Smart Classroom Attendance and Management System provides
a simple and efficient way to manage classroom attendance
digitally. It reduces manual work and makes attendance records
easier to store and access.

